# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# type(nn-section): What have been done

# --------------------------------------------------
# <Types> - Recommended
# feat = new feature
# doc = documentation
# fix = bug fix
# impr = improvement
# style = aesthetics, ergonomics
# refactor = refactoring
# perf = performance
# test = added/modified tests
# build = application build 

# (scope) - optional
# specifies the section of the codebase

# :<Subject> - Imperative
# max 72 characters

# Examples:
# feat(10-AI-vibe-coding): AI coding - Laboratory application & installation guide gerated
# doc(15-AI-doc-generation): AI documentation - User Guide genreated 
# doc(99-templates): AI assistance - Templates to follow for clarity
# doc(nn-xxxx, section): AI assistance - Update installation instructions
# refactor(nn-xxxx, section): AI code review - simplify date formatting logic


